msgid "Elizabeth's third SG.\nExactly what kind of \"purity\" that is will be left to\nthe reader's imagination.\n\nServants are reproduced in the prime form of their life.\nSo this Elizabeth is in the form of an unwed daughter of\nHouse Báthory, a girl in love with love…… one assumes.\n\n             ◆\n\nAn idol must be pure as snow.\nForget romance;\nthe moment she knows love, her radiance is lost.\nSo long as she immerses herself in the idol business,\nthis SG will forever be indestructible.\n"
